WEBVTT

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:16.580
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:27.600
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but reality moves on.</i>

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:33.130
<i>Treat love as love, treat</i>
<i>dreams as dreams.</i>

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:38.640
<i>It's difficult to say it in earnest.</i>
<i>The times forge ahead, but...</i>

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:43.620
<i>I want to make you happy...</i>

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:49.410
<i>I'll do so like I do to</i>
<i>be myself. Yeah!</i>

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:54.380
<i>I'll make you happy...</i>

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:59.790
<i>I dedicate all that</i>
<i>I can do to you.</i>

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:11.110
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:23.360
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but love doesn't stop for me.</i>

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:57.550
This is it.

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:02.560
FILE. 17
THAT 20-YEAR-OLD
IS MY MOTHER!

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:05.190
I'm telling you. You really
don't have to do this.

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:08.230
Don't be ridiculous. We know you're
living on a diet of noodles.

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:14.530
Yeah! And you have two wonderful and
kind women offering to cook for you.

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:18.010
Plus, we've already gone and
bought all these vegetables!

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:23.440
Why can't we come over? Got a woman
hidden in your apartment?

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:26.450
Wha! As if I'd have
a woman there!

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:27.790
We know you wouldn't.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:29.520
We know you wouldn't.
Don't get all defensive.

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:40.130
Understand? You stay right there
until I tell you to come up.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:43.470
You told us already! What do you think
we're standing down here for?!

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:50.370
<i>I can't let them see</i>
<i>this pigsty!</i>

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:53.410
Maybe he's hiding all his
porno magazines.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.550
Lay off him,
will you?

00:02:58.920 --> 00:02:59.950
"Caution for fire"

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:01.650
Nakajima!
"Caution for fire"

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:09.730
Hi! Back already, Ken?
These your friends?

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:14.730
M... Miyuki! Miyuki!

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:17.100
Who are you?

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:21.460
What kind of way is that
to talk to your Mother?

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:25.800
My, you've gone white
as a ghost.

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:31.240
Excuse me, but you sure look
young. How old are you?

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.540
Oh, I'll be 20
this year.

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:37.780
20 minus 26 means she had the baby
6 years before she was born.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:42.520
Wait a sec, I got it, she had him when
she was 16, so he's four...

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.700
Which can't be right. What the?

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.430
...and he looks older, so...

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:49.530
I've totally confused
them.

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:52.100
"Family Register"
"Daimaru Nakajima & Sena Wakabayashi"

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:56.200
I see. So you're engaged to
marry Nakajima's father?

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:57.430
That's right.

00:03:57.610 --> 00:03:59.870
So Daimaru's marrying a young,
sweet girl like you, huh?

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:02.470
Quite the smooth operator,
isn't he?

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:05.850
But he still hasn't completed
all the formalities.

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:08.610
There's one
condition.

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:10.290
What condition?

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:13.820
Ken here has to call me his "Mother."

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:15.620
Ew, yuck! That's
gross!

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:18.430
Why does he always go
and do stuff like this?

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:20.120
He can't go making deals
like this on his own!

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:23.360
Oh, Ken. I don't think you're
being fair to him.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:26.200
He's just thinking of your
feelings, that's all.

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:29.210
If you oppose our relationship,
then we won't get married.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:33.070
Yeah, I guess
you're right.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:38.780
<i>Hmm... She seems awfully mature,</i>
<i>despite her age and appearance.</i>

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:42.110
So please, call
me "Mom!"

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:44.120
Then again,
maybe not.

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:45.820
Come on! Call me Mommy!

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:49.060
You can't be serious! I can't do that!

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:51.960
Just once! What's the big deal?!

00:04:58.100 --> 00:05:00.000
Thanks for
dinner.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:02.870
Well, Ken, I'll be off
for the night.

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:04.410
But I'll be back again
tomorrow!

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:06.570
Where are you
going?

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:09.540
To your Dad's.
Where else?

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:10.840
Hey, wait!
Hey!

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:21.320
There's nothing wrong with her going to
your Dad's place. They are engaged.

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:23.590
What is it, Nakajima?
You a Daddy's boy?

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:27.050
I am not! It's just that my
Dad's still in Suzuka.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.300
That reminds me. What
about his bike shop?

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:32.900
She said she'd be back
here tomorrow!

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:43.480
Kobayakawa...
Stop that!

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:50.150
Huh? Who on
earth is that?

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:53.450
Yeah?

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:55.820
Good morning, Ken!

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:19.680
Miyuki, take
a look.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:23.320
So she came all the way from Suzuka
just to drop him off at work?!

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:26.220
Who's that girl with
Nakajima?

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.120
His little
sister?

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:30.350
I've never heard about him
having a little sister.

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:33.920
I think I smell another
juicy story.

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:39.500
Yoriko! Now don't you go around
making up rumors about this.

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:40.540
That girl...

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:43.770
Have a good day
at work, Ken!

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:45.670
Uh... Yeah...

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:52.210
Damn it! Dad, when I get
my hands on you...

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:05.060
Where in the heck could
he be at this hour?

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:08.530
Hi, Nakajima! I hear you're
in a bit of a bind!

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:11.900
We heard that your new stepmother's
been pushing you around...

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.970
...and you can't even go
back to your place!

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:16.540
Hey, if you need someone
to talk to, we're all ears!

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:18.270
Huh?!

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:21.810
I completely misjudged
you, Nakajima.

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:23.710
What about poor
Miyuki?

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:28.580
She may be young and cute, but how could
you do that with your stepmother?!

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:31.520
Wha... Now hold on! What
are you talking about?!

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:36.960
How come ugly guys like you are always
surrounded by beautiful girls?!

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:40.200
I won't tell you how to
run your private life...

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:43.860
...but just don't taint your reputation
as a police officer.

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:49.140
W... Wait, Chief!

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:51.870
Chief!

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:58.610
That's right! She drove him
to work again today.

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:01.980
And even though she's his stepmother,
that's twice she's driven him now.

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:03.180
Poor Miyuki!

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:07.150
You never learn,
do you?

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:09.450
I told you not to go spreading
strange rumors!

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:14.000
I was just telling everyone
the truth, that's all!

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:18.290
It's Nakajima's life. It's none
of our business...

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:20.340
...so we should stop nosing around
in his private affairs.

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.470
Do you know what
you're saying?

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:24.630
This directly affects you
as well, you know?

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:25.900
What?

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.050
If she's going to be Naka-
jima's mother...

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:31.480
...that means she's going to be
your mother-in-law, right?

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:34.480
My mother-in-law?

00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:35.950
What?!

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:40.590
Hey, that's right! When you
and Nakajima get married...

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:42.630
...you'll have a mother-in-law
who's younger than you are!

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:46.030
Come on, Natsumi!
Not you, too!

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:50.500
Hi, Aoi.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.060
Hi, Aoi.
Sorry to bother you.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:54.140
I figured you'd
all be here.

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:55.870
What is it?

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:59.140
What is it?
There's a lady named Sena here.

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:01.040
What'd you say?

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:04.850
Thank you for always taking good
care of my little Kennie.

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:09.850
I brought a little something
for everyone.

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:13.290
My, that was very kind
of you. Thanks.

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:17.930
What the?

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:20.690
What are you
doing here?

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:22.290
I thought you'd already
gone home!

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:25.700
Calm down. I just came to drop
off your lunch and some treats.

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:29.370
I thought I'd introduce myself to your
colleagues. As your Mother, that is.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:31.440
You didn't have
to do that!

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:34.700
"Odango;" small, sweet snack food
Here, I brought some odango
from Gotoh-Ya that you love.

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:36.800
Don't worry, I made sure to
get enough for you, too.

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:39.240
Uh... Well...

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:47.220
Uh... Hi, Sena! This isn't really the right
place to chat. Can you come with us?

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:48.920
Huh?

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:54.360
Perfect timing! We can all
have lunch together!

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:58.060
What the?

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:01.260
It was nice meeting
you all!

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:16.310
Not bad...

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:36.610
Wow!

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:38.780
There... There...

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:44.480
I made enough for everyone,
so please help yourselves.

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:46.240
Gee, it looks
delicious!

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:49.580
Ouch!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:52.250
Just keep to yourself,
will you?

00:10:52.990 --> 00:10:54.390
Go ahead and
have some.

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:56.690
You can't say, "Just like
my Mama made," yet...

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:59.890
...but I don't think it's that
bad. Here, open wide.

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:02.090
No thanks, I can
eat on my own.

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.240
Come on, open wide!

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:06.200
Come on, open wide!
No...

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:11.400
Here, Miyuki. This omelette
is one of my best dishes.

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:13.670
Oh, really? I'd
love some.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:21.080
You have to admit, they look more
like lovers than mother and son.

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:25.710
Yoriko! If you keep meddling in the affairs
of others, you'll lose all your friends.

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:29.490
Look who's talking! You've been staring
at them as much as anyone else!

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:33.760
I... I was just sitting here thinking
about how good this food is!

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:37.900
Gee. Seems like we're really
sticking out in the crowd.

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:39.500
Uh... D'huh...

00:11:42.770 --> 00:11:43.740
Hello! Nice
day.

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:49.580
What happened
to Nakajima?

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:52.670
He just eats his lunch,
then takes off.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:54.550
I don't think he means
anything by it.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:57.620
I think he's
just shy.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:02.490
Miyuki, you know a lot
about Ken, don't you?

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:03.660
Not really.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:06.490
No, really. I can tell just
by looking at him.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:08.730
He has a big place in
his heart for you.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.770
In that way, he's just as
sweet as his Father.

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:17.410
Really...

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:24.080
Can you tell Ken I'll come back
to pick him up this evening?

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:25.050
Okay.

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:26.220
Oh, Sena.

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:26.950
Yes?

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.090
Are you going all the way
back to Suzuka tonight?

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.350
Why don't you stay the
night at our place?

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.950
It's a long way to
travel every day.

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:37.890
You're right
about that.

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:40.200
Is it all right with you, Natsumi?

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:41.860
You bet. Why wouldn't it be?

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:46.270
Well, if you insist, then
that's just what I'll do.

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:55.240
I'm all done with
the bath.

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:58.710
Hey, Sena. Mind if I ask
you something?

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:00.680
Not at all. What
is it?

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:02.790
How did you and
Daimaru meet?

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:07.650
Well, that's...

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:34.880
That was the
first time.

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:37.920
That mountain pass was as familiar as my
own yard and I'd yet to lose to anyone.

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.890
And he was on a motor-
bike to boot!

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:45.730
It was a real shock
to me.

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:53.440
I saw him later at
a rest stop...

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:56.130
...and without even thinking I went
up and started talking to him.

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:58.040
<i>"You've been riding</i>
<i>here for awhile!"</i>

00:13:58.210 --> 00:14:00.870
<i>"This was my first time</i>
<i>through the pass."</i>

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:03.540
<i>"I just listened to the road, and</i>
<i>it told me how to drive it."</i>

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:11.490
I knew then that he was
a man of substance.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:23.160
And I've given my heart
to him ever since.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:26.130
I think I understand
how you feel.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:27.100
Mm-hmm.

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:32.910
And I don't want Ken to call me
"Mother" just because...

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:36.850
...I want to marry Daimaru.
It's because if he does...

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:39.610
...I think I'll really be able to become
a member of the family.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:44.380
All right! We're here to help
you make it happen!

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:45.450
Really?

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:47.950
If you don't push Naka-
jima a little...

00:14:48.060 --> 00:14:52.330
...things will just drag on and on, and
he'll never tell you his true feelings.

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:54.590
Ahem. Exactly.

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:58.860
After all, nobody knows his indecisive
side better than Miyuki.

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:00.470
Geez!

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:03.700
Anyway, Nakajima's
off duty tomorrow...

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:06.400
...so how about taking him
on a little shopping trip?

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:11.880
"Let's all obey the traffic laws"

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:17.550
Okay, Ken, time to go mother-
and-son shopping!

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:19.160
Come on, let's go!

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:21.630
Come on, let's go!
Hey! Wait!

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:32.960
Listen, I haven't been able
to get a hold of Dad.

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:34.830
Do you have any idea
where he is?

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:38.440
He's probably gone
on a bike trip.

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:40.870
Just like him. Gone when
I need him the most.

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:46.710
Oh, this is
adorable!

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:48.010
Will you buy
it for me?

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:50.150
Me? Why should
I buy it?

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:53.190
Why shouldn't you buy a present
for your Mother?

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:55.330
Hang on a
minute!

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:58.930
Going just as
planned.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.360
Are we ready for
the next step?

00:16:00.530 --> 00:16:02.400
All set!

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.260
1st Unit here. The
target is in range.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:06.060
Roger.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:12.640
I envy you, getting your boyfriend
to buy this for you.

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:15.050
No, he's my son.

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:16.480
No, he's my son.
Huh?

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.550
Will that be cash
or charge?

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:27.250
I... l'll charge it. I'll have to pay
this off with my bonus.

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:29.950
I'll just ring it up. Thank
you very much.

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:40.730
Hey, babe. You
by yourself?

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:41.840
Huh?

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.240
Want to have a coffee
with us?

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:51.280
Where did you find the two
pickup artists anyway?

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:55.080
They're biker buddies of mine. They had
some free time, so I asked them to help.

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:58.480
They're good, aren't they? Doesn't
seem like they're acting.

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:01.260
That's because they
do this all the time!

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:03.420
So that means you ended
up picking them up.

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:07.430
Hey, you two! What do you
think you're doing?

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:09.090
Ken!

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:11.670
What do you want? It's
none of your business.

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:14.300
Yeah, we're talking
to her.

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:17.200
It is my business!
She's my...

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:18.410
Here it comes!

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:19.910
She's my...

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:21.400
This is it!

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.440
She's my...

00:17:24.550 --> 00:17:25.410
...little sister!

00:17:25.780 --> 00:17:28.380
Aah!

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:37.120
You have to be
more careful.

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:39.700
There are guys like that all
over the place in Tokyo.

00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:41.090
Mm-hmm.

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:42.990
Are you mad?

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:46.590
Calling you my little sister...
It just came out.

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:54.980
It's not like I'm opposed
to your getting married.

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:57.580
It's just that...

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:03.810
I know it's hard to call someone "Mother"
when she's younger than you.

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:05.550
I won't pressure
you anymore.

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:08.090
Let's just start out
by being friends.

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:12.060
I'll just drop this off, then let's
grab something to eat.

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:16.500
Are you sure you're doing
the right thing?

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:18.930
You could have just said
it once, for her sake!

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:21.590
Huh?! What are you
two doing here?

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:25.630
Hurry up, man!

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:29.680
Wait a second. This
one goes like this...

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:30.710
That's it!
Did it!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:33.010
Wha?

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:35.150
Hmm? Oh no!
Floor it!

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:36.820
What are you doing?!
Stop right there!

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:37.610
Got it!

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:49.130
Why couldn't you just call her
"Mother?" Just once?!

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:55.400
Wait a minute, wasn't that
Sena's "Super 7?"

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:57.540
I didn't hire anybody to do that!

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:58.370
What?!

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:04.650
Dad!

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:05.620
I'll follow him!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.780
Nakajima, let's go find Sena!

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:29.670
Damn!

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:31.870
Hey, punks!

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:35.810
What the hell?!

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:46.090
Run for it!

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:48.060
I'm running!

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:52.030
Hey, you
creeps!

00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:55.860
How about a Tokyo Special
Roundhouse Kick?!

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.730
Are you okay? Are
you in pain?

00:20:02.940 --> 00:20:04.430
Speak to me!

00:20:04.610 --> 00:20:08.010
Thank goodness. I'm glad
this didn't break.

00:20:08.110 --> 00:20:11.240
It's my first present
from my son.

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:17.190
But I'd hoped that
before the end...

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:20.280
...you would have called
me "Mother."

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:24.750
I'll say it! I'll say
it over and over!

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:27.260
Mom!

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:35.700
MOM!

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:40.670
You finally did
it, eh, Ken?

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.710
Wha... Huh... Um...

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:45.510
Rats, I scraped
my elbow.

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.510
Are you okay,
Sena?

00:20:47.690 --> 00:20:50.750
You bet. Ken called
me "Mom!"

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:54.510
Looks like Sena's put one
over on Nakajima.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:55.720
Sure does.

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.390
Wha... Urk...

00:20:59.560 --> 00:21:02.260
I came by to look at the planned
site for the shop.

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:04.890
Oh, I see. You must be
pretty happy, too.

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.260
Wha... Huh...

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:08.200
No... Wha?

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:10.200
So, what do
you think?

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:13.610
Looks like Sena's satisfied my
conditions. Son, how about...

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:17.170
...we have a double ceremony; you
and Miyuki and Sena and I?

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:18.580
Ahhh.

00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:19.910
What are you saying, Dad?

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:24.650
Just kidding. I know you don't have
it in you to propose to someone.

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:28.690
From now on, we're going
to be a family, Ken!

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:12.400
<i>I live my life my own way, doing</i>
<i>things others wouldn't.</i>

00:22:12.670 --> 00:22:21.010
<i>Being strong isn't enough.</i>
<i>It makes me Ionely.</i>

00:22:23.710 --> 00:22:32.020
<i>I can feel your presence</i>
<i>as if you're right here...</i>

00:22:32.560 --> 00:22:40.130
<i>... but I can't say a word.</i>

00:22:41.670 --> 00:22:48.930
<i>The feelings I hide within might</i>
<i>break into pieces...</i>

00:22:50.410 --> 00:22:57.780
<i>But if I don't say anything,</i>
<i>nothing can begin.</i>

00:22:58.120 --> 00:23:05.350
<i>The wind gently blows...</i>
<i>Time flows...</i>

00:23:05.520 --> 00:23:15.070
<i>Time flows... And soon</i>
<i>I can be honest...</i>

00:23:15.200 --> 00:23:18.170
<i>Thank you,</i>
<i>friend!</i>

00:23:24.410 --> 00:23:26.310
"Unidentified Female Objects"

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:28.600
Hey, Yoriko, listen
to this!

00:23:28.710 --> 00:23:30.480
Little boys these days
are just too rough!

00:23:30.580 --> 00:23:34.350
Tehe... I heard that you guys got your
skirts lifted by some schoolkids...

00:23:34.450 --> 00:23:36.420
...and you retaliated
by pantsing them!

00:23:36.590 --> 00:23:38.280
Only Natsumi would do
something like that!

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:40.760
No way! I'm a complete
victim here!

00:23:40.860 --> 00:23:43.160
There's something fishy
about this situation.

00:23:43.260 --> 00:23:45.250
Yeah, I've got a feeling
he'll pop up again.

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:49.300
Next time on You're Under Arrest,
File 18, "The Strike Brigade."

00:23:49.370 --> 00:23:51.300
I knew it was "Strike" related!
